n- To fix or extend a skill, return it again under the same name with the full new body. Don't split a procedure's steps into bullets, and don't make a skill for a single rule.\nThe same credential rule applies to skills: never a credential, say where it comes from.\nMost sessions add nothing. Reply exactly: {\"tag\": [{\"id\": \"p1\", \"tag\": \"helpful\"}], \"add\": [{\"text\": \"...\", \"scope\": \"project\"}], \"update\": [{\"id\": \"p2\", \"text\": \"...\"}], \"remove\": [\"g1\"], \"skills\": [{\"name\": \"...\", \"description\": \"...\", \"body\": \"...\"}]}"
